# Music commands

## `music.playlists.load`

Load a playlist from a file or another service.

- CLI: `media music playlists load`
- Kind: action
- Scope: music:edit
- Arguments: `{ source: "spotify" | "file"; tracks: Array<{ title: string; seconds: number }>; tags: Record<string, boolean>; owner: Id<"users">; size: bigint; cover?: ArrayBuffer; "dry-run": true; version: 2n }`
- Result: `{ playlistId: Id<"playlists"> } | null`
